sequenceDiagram
    participant HealthStore as NHS HealthStore
    participant Platform as Supplier platform

    Note over HealthStore,Platform: X-Request-ID on every call, mirrored in the response. A retry replays the request exactly.
    Note over HealthStore,Platform: Each side sends its access token as a bearer on every call,<br/>cached against expires_in, re-acquired on expiry or 401.

    HealthStore->>Platform: POST /oauth/token<br/>client_credentials, credentials issued by the platform
    Platform-->>HealthStore: 200 access token, expires_in

    HealthStore->>Platform: POST /healthstore-registration-requests<br/>Task requested: process-specific-service-request (focus)<br/>or process-available-service-requests (groupIdentifier)
    Platform-->>HealthStore: 200 Task accepted, identifier echoed, lastModified set

    Platform->>HealthStore: POST /oauth2/token<br/>client_credentials, credentials issued by NHS HealthStore
    HealthStore-->>Platform: 200 access token, expires_in

    alt one registration
        Platform->>HealthStore: GET /registrations/{registration-id}
        HealthStore-->>Platform: 200 ServiceRequest, Patient contained
    else a cohort
        loop until the worklist returns nothing
            Platform->>HealthStore: GET /registrations?cohort&_count&page
            HealthStore-->>Platform: 200 searchset Bundle of ServiceRequests
        end
    end

    Platform->>HealthStore: POST /registrations/{registration-id}/tasks<br/>Task: registration accepted or rejected
    HealthStore-->>Platform: 200, the registration leaves the worklist

    Note over Platform: Patient first opens the digital therapeutic
    Platform->>HealthStore: POST /registrations/{registration-id}/tasks<br/>Task: activation
    HealthStore-->>Platform: 200
